{
 "_README": [
  "Reply templates for the POLpro plaintext channel (services/polpro.py).",
  "",
  "This file is BIND-MOUNTED READ-ONLY at /config and re-read whenever its",
  "mtime changes, so editing it takes effect on the NEXT REQUEST -- no rebuild",
  "and no restart. That matters: this traffic arrives on the auth band, and",
  "restarting that container is what kicks the player out of their session.",
  "",
  "FORMAT -- {command tag: [entry, ...]}, entry is either:",
  "    \"echo\"            splice the request's own groups back in",
  "    [\"TAG\", [vals]]   an explicit group",
  "Values may use placeholders:",
  "    $0..$9     Nth value of the request's FIRST group",
  "    $TAG.N     Nth value of the request's <TAG> group",
  "An unknown placeholder resolves to \"0\" rather than failing mid-request.",
  "",
  "Set POL_POLPRO=0 to go back to capture-only silence.",
  ""
